  "slug": "simple-artichoke-dip",
  "name": "Simple Artichoke Dip",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Easy artichoke dip made with just three ingredients: artichokes, mayonnaise, and Parmesan cheese. Bake for just 15 minutes and serve with pita chips.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C)."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Mix artichoke hearts, mayonnaise, and Parmesan cheese together in a bowl until well combined."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Spread mixture in a 9x13-inch baking dish."
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until bubbly and golden brown, about 15 to 20 minutes."
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "text": "Serve and enjoy! Believe it or not, you'll need just three ingredients for this easy artichoke dip recipe: a can of artichoke hearts, mayonnaise, and Parmesan cheese. Of course, you can customize the ingredients or spice it up however you like."
    }
  ],
